  - dialogueText: 'If that''s the case, from one spy to another, none of this shouldn''t
      be of your concern.

      You''re smart, I respect that, so I''ll tell you
      this: we''re not here to kill anyone.

      i''ll let this slide, but if you
      dare enter here again... let''s just say it will no longer be a murder "attempt",
      if you get my drift.'
