    - rid: 3046478613006778471
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'So he trusts you, then. And yet he felt like he had no reason
          to tell me about you.

          Seriously, why do i seem to be the only
          one who knows how to do my job properly?

          Ok, so then you must
          have come here looking for something. Be quick.'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
